Add Tags and Receive Gifts!
 

✨ Friends, we can see many new players and want to ask you all, what do you think are the best tags for the game? We'll gift 100 units of Eltanite for your troubles. ✨

 

What needs to be done to receive the gifts?

1. Log into Steam and go to the Royal Quest Online page in the store;

2. Click on the "+" icon in the "Popular user-defined tags for this product" section;

3. Add a new tag in the opened window;

4. In the comments under this post, list the tags you have added. They could be "Crafting," "Playing with friends," "MMORPG," or any others.

 

When will I receive the gifts?

All players who left a comment with tags from June 27, 15:00 (UTC) to July 2, 10:00 (UTC), will receive 100 units of Eltanite (Account bound). The gifts will be credited to the players' Golden Chests during the next maintenance.

 
Share your tags with us, and we'll share gifts with you 😉

